      "content": "i dont even know what to do anymore. everything is just... gone. the bank called today and it's official. i'm gonna lose the house by the end of the month. i've tried everything, i've worked every extra shift, i've cut everything out... but the math just doesn't work. there's just no way out of this. it feels like i'm drowning and there's no air left.",
